      "url": "https://agent-ops-kit-5jb.pages.dev/",
      "date": "2026-11-10",
      "authors": [
        "Rippy Productions"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand practical failure modes when deploying autonomous agents across production infrastructure. You will learn why agents drift into self-reinforcing echo chambers and how to build gates that inspect live systems instead of document claims.",
