        "Xueqi Cheng"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how agent performance fundamentally depends on the surrounding harness rather than just the model itself. You will learn how the Doc2Harness framework systematically evaluates an LLM's capacity to build complex execution harnesses from specifications.",
