      "date": "2026-11-10",
      "authors": [
        "blong8334"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how mapping dependencies and callers can replace manual line diffs when reviewing complex pull requests. It demonstrates a progressive review workflow tailored to handle rapid AI code generation without missing critical risks.",
