      "authors": [
        "ashvolt"
      ],
      "why_read": "Learn how to systematically test durable execution workflows against edge cases like crashes and timeouts to prevent duplicate external side effects. You will understand how fault injection helps audit external calls that fall outside durability guarantees.",
