      "authors": [
        "mkorun"
      ],
      "why_read": "Learn how to run rootless, sub-second Firecracker microVMs inside WSL2 to securely isolate untrusted agent code. It explains the mechanics of combining bubblewrap, user namespaces, and vsock in a nested virtualization stack.",
      "hn_id": "50439919",
