      "date": "2026-11-10",
      "authors": [
        "el3tty"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how to build and execute neural networks directly on the Kendryte K230 RISC-V accelerator from source. It explains how this compiler fork handles pre-quantized ONNX models, the NPU runtime, and deployment tools.",
